@startuml 06d-fields
' 图 06D：关键 subject / evidence 字段专述（inline 注释 + 案例赋值）。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

title 图 06D · Subject / Evidence 字段绑定
caption <color:#6E6963>equality 须字段级比较（含 tombstone）；禁止 JSON.stringify 顺序误判。06A。</color>

class "EngineeringAdmissionEvidenceSubject" as ESub #FFFDFC {
  +admissionId: string
  .. 例：adm-sealed-001 ..
  +activationDomainId: string
  .. 例：default ..
  +fromSchemaRef: SchemaRef
  +toSchemaRef: SchemaRef
  +fromEpochId / toEpochId: EpochId
  .. 例：42 → 43 ..
  +fromEpochOrdinal / toEpochOrdinal: number
  .. 例：1 → 2 ..
  +extensionPlanDigest: ContentDigest
  +expectedRuntimeHead: SnapshotRef
  .. 例：snap-S0；须与 binding 对齐 ..
  +expectedBindingGeneration: number
  .. 例：1 ..
  +tombstone?: boolean
  .. 例：false；equality 含此字段 ..
}

class "RuleOccurrenceSubject" as RSub #FFFDFC {
  +artifactSubjectRef: string
  +signatureVersion: string
  +epochId: string
  +ruleId: string
  +occurrenceId: string
  +beforeSnapshotRef: SnapshotRef
  +eventRef: ChangeId
  +afterSnapshotRef: SnapshotRef
  +replayRecipeRef: string
  .. 例：recipe-chain:sha256:{chainDigest} ..
}

class "DpoReplayExecutionEvidence" as DpoEv #FFFDFC {
  +recipeRef: string
  .. 须匹配 durable recipe 链 digest ..
  +deterministic: boolean
  .. 须 true ..
  +replayDigest: ContentDigest
  .. 绑定 subject+endpoints+changeCount ..
  +fromSnapshotRef: SnapshotRef
  +toSnapshotRef: SnapshotRef
  +changes: CoordinationChange[]
}

class "PackageConformanceCertificate" as Cert #FFFDFC {
  +certificateId: CertificateId
  +evidenceRootDigest: ContentDigest
  .. 须 = ReviewedDecision.verified ..
  +notBefore / expiresAt: ISO8601
  +supersedes?: CertificateId
  +status.release: accepted|revoked|expired
}

ESub --> Cert : prepare subject 绑定
RSub --> DpoEv : replayRecipeRef = recipeRef
DpoEv --> RSub : endpoint refs 对齐

@enduml
